HAPI-derived portions
---------------------
Persistent workspace geometry and native input compatibility contain adaptations
from HAPI, including shared/src/workspaces.ts, web workspace behavior, and native
Codex contracts. The appearance palette definitions, original color blending
algorithms, source header preferences, bulk session actions and Web Share
transfer compatibility also adapt the pinned HAPI source. Copyright HAPI
contributors. The source references in the
adapted files are preserved.
Original Enter and external-link preferences retain the source keys and
input/navigation meaning. Earlier releases also adapted HAPI's Cursor model
catalog and CLI SKU picker, machine health schema and formatting, and Companion
share-picker behavior. Those runtime entries are retired; their attribution and
historical source snapshots remain for provenance and explicit offline recovery.

