DeepSeek Harness
----------------
The project uses official @deepseek-ai/dsh runtime services together with a
source-built set of 22 modified DSH packages. The current complete extension
release is hhpi-dsh-022-20261107.27. Its consolidated patch, contract tests and
source references are in source-snapshots/dsh-ext/source.patch and the matching
source manifest; build and reconstruction instructions are in
docs/hhpi-extension-install.md. The corresponding source, lockfile, build tools
and original license accompany each extension release. DeepSeek Harness and
these modified packages retain the MIT License.

