Speech and historical voice adapters
--------------------------------------
The browser-local speech eligibility and dictation behavior retain HAPI-derived
code under AGPL-3.0-only. Current dictation uses the browser's explicitly
supported local speech recognition capability.

Earlier releases also adapted HAPI voice protocols, personality, context
formatting, audio conversion and provider lifecycle modules, and used the
unmodified ElevenLabs React and client SDKs 0.13.0 under the MIT License.
Those remote voice integrations are retired and the current browser artifact
does not load ElevenLabs SDKs. Historical provenance remains in
src/voice/UPSTREAM.md. Original notices are retained in
docs/licenses/ELEVENLABS-REACT-MIT.txt,
docs/licenses/ELEVENLABS-CLIENT-MIT.txt and
docs/licenses/ELEVENLABS-TYPES-MIT.txt.

Conversation image export
-------------------------
The browser artifact bundles unmodified html2canvas-pro 2.2.4, the version
pinned by the original HAPI baseline, to rasterize a reviewed, read-only copy
of the official DSH Conversation DOM. It does not replace a chat renderer.
Copyright (c) 2024-present yorickshan and html2canvas-pro contributors.
Original MIT license: docs/licenses/HTML2CANVAS-PRO-MIT.txt.

